===== jail-mechanics/recipes/tools.md =====
# tools

Install tools using the host's normal package manager. For a permanent host configuration change, run `yolo check` and then `yolo host apply` from `/home/test/project`.

===== jail-mechanics/recipes/user-config.md =====
# user config

1. Give the human the exact edit for `/home/test/.config/yolo-jail/config.jsonc`.
2. Ask them to run `yolo check` there.
3. Run `yolo host apply` from `/home/test/project`.
